<title>USA: Shaler ASD, Pa., won by  PNC Securities.</title>
<headline>Shaler ASD, Pa., won by  PNC Securities.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>PNC Securities Corp., said it won $9.995 million of Shaler ASD, Pa., general obligation bonds, Series 1997, with a true interest cost of 5.27 percent.</p>
